    "id": "2023arkansascourtofappealsleslieswaffordvdirectordepartmentofworkforceservicesmajority",
    "judge_ruling": " AR 685 leslie swafford leslie n swafford a resident and citizen of arizona seeking to re enter the united states after having been deported from arizona by the department of workforce services dws filed suit on june 19 2014 in the district court for the western district of arkansas alleging dws breached his rights under the deportation order he received which authorized him only to return to the united states and that no longer allowed him access into arizona the magistrate judge issued a summary judgment ruling dismissing swafford\u2019s complaint on appeal the superior court granted the motion for summary judgment leslie n swafford v director department of workforce services majority 2019 AR CORL 537 leslie n swafford leslie n swafford resident and citizen of arizona who had been a resident and citizen in mexico when he entered the united states by land on september 14 2006 seeking to re enter the united states after being deported from arizona dws filed suit the superior court issued its summary judgment ruling swafford appealed leslie",
    "pdf": "https://cases.justia.com/arkansas/court-of-appeals/2023-e-22-209.pdf?ts=1683731207",
